{
  "id": "envoy-outlier-ejection",
  "adapter": "envoy",
  "title": "Envoy outlier detection: a host failing 3 consecutive requests is ejected",
  "source": "envoy.yaml",
  "allow_rejection": false,
  "backend_faults": {
    "a": 503
  },
  "claims": [
    "a round-robin STATIC cluster of two hosts with outlier_detection consecutive_5xx 3 and max_ejection_percent 50 ejects the host answering 503 after its third consecutive 503",
    "after the ejection, requests reach only the healthy host for the base ejection time (300s, equal to max_ejection_time, so it does not grow)"
  ],
  "not_claimed": [
    "re-admission timing (the source re-admits at its next interval sweep after the ejection time)",
    "success-rate ejection (disabled here with enforcing_success_rate: 0)"
  ],
  "source_semantics": "Envoy outlier detection (source/common/upstream/outlier_detection_impl.cc): a host is ejected after consecutive_5xx consecutive 5xx responses when (ejected + 1) * 100 / hosts <= max_ejection_percent, for base_ejection_time times its ejection count, capped at max(base_ejection_time, max_ejection_time). Source-code-inferred unless the upstream differential runs.",
  "probes": [
